#! case: editor output, several profiles
ok
profile one target C:\backup\one
source C:\data\one recursive True exclude [] include [] exclude-globs []
retention none
concurrency none
profile all target C:\backup\all
source C:\data\one recursive False exclude [tmp|a b] include [**/*.md] exclude-globs [*.bak]
source C:\data\two recursive True exclude [] include [] exclude-globs []
retention 7 4 12 3
concurrency 4 8
profile two target C:\backup\two
source C:\data\two recursive True exclude [] include [] exclude-globs []
retention none
concurrency none
